  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FFD866><b>Addressables \uB85C \uD558\uB294 \uBC95 (\uD328\uD0A4\uC9C0 \uBBF8\uC124\uCE58)</b></color>\n1. Package Manager > <b>Addressables</b> \uC124\uCE58\n2. \uC2A4\uD14C\uC774\uC9C0 \uD504\uB9AC\uD339 Inspector > <b>Addressable</b> \uCCB4\uD06C, \uC8FC\uC18C \"stage1\"\n3. Window > Asset Management > Addressables > Groups\n   \uC2A4\uD14C\uC774\uC9C0\uBCC4 \uADF8\uB8F9(Stage1, Stage2\u2026)\uC73C\uB85C \uB098\uB204\uAE30\n4. \uBD88\uB7EC\uC624\uAE30\n<noparse>   var h = Addressables.LoadAssetAsync<GameObject>(\"stage1\");\n   await h.Task;  Instantiate(h.Result);\n   // \uB610\uB294 Addressables.InstantiateAsync(\"stage1\")</noparse>\n5. \uB0B4\uB824\uB193\uAE30: <b>Addressables.Release(h)</b> / ReleaseInstance\n6. Groups \uCC3D Build > New Build > Default Build Script\n\n<color=#9BE89B>\uC774 \uC52C \uB300\uCCB4</color>: Resources.LoadAsync + UnloadUnusedAssets\nResources \uB294 \uBE4C\uB4DC\uC5D0 \uC804\uBD80 \uD3EC\uD568\xB7\uD328\uCE58 \uBD88\uAC00 \u2192 \uC2E4\uC81C \uD504\uB85C\uC81D\uD2B8\uB294 Addressables \uAD8C\uC7A5"
